# YouTube Comment Analysis

## About This Project

I built this project to explore how real-world social media data can be collected and analyzed using R and the YouTube Data API.

Using the YouTube Data API, I collected comments from a YouTube video and analyzed them in R. The project helped me learn how to work with APIs, JSON data, data cleaning, and exploratory data analysis (EDA).

## What I Did

- Connected to the YouTube Data API
- Collected public YouTube comments
- Converted JSON data into an R data frame
- Cleaned and explored the data
- Analyzed likes and replies
- Created visualizations

## Tools

- R
- RStudio
- YouTube Data API
- httr
